# Optional override for Login / Get started links (trailing slash ignored).
# If unset: on your real domain → https://app.<that-domain>; on localhost or *.github.io → https://app.dermiciq.com
# VITE_APP_URL=https://app.dermiciq.com

# Optional. API origin for contact form POST + future server features (see client/src/lib/apiOrigin.ts).
# VITE_API_ORIGIN=https://app.dermiciq.com
#
# Omit for GitHub Pages-only preview (mailto contact, no auth server).

# Vite asset base (production builds only):
# - Leave unset → use package.json "homepage" (e.g. /dermiciq.com/ for GitHub project Pages).
# - VITE_BASE=/ → apex custom domain (dermiciq.com). Use: npm run build:apex
